Question: Given a drug SMILES string, predict whether it
(A) does not cross the BBB (B) crosses the BBB
Drug SMILES: COc1ccc(-c2cc(=O)c3c(O)cc(O[C@@H]4O[C@H](CO[C@@H]5O[C@@H](C)[C@H](O)[C@@H](O)[C@H]5O)[C@@H](O)[C@H](O)[C@H]4O)cc3o2)cc1O
